Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.47,0:02:44.19,Thought,,0,0,0,,{girly chatter}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.56,0:02:46.94,Thought,,0,0,0,,Those thighs...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.34,0:02:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And then she bends over... can you imagine it? {????????? no clue}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.42,0:02:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot! Keep it down!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.29,0:02:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be rough in this heat. {to stay in a closet}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.16,0:03:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.45,0:03:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to see a naked girl that badly, \Nall you had to do was ask me... {and I'd show you}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.59,0:03:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell I would! \NYou insufferable perverts! {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.92,0:03:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{girly complain, a lot of "pervert" and "Geez"}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.69,0:03:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{ow ow}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.26,0:03:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the second time you two \Nhave been caught peeping.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.24,0:03:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do with them, girls?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.17,0:03:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Strip them naked and throw them outside!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.96,0:03:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, do that! {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.01,0:03:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly! Serves them right!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.34,0:03:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all whip them together! {lit: let's tease them together - idk how that's supposed to be a punishment?}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.06,0:03:40.16,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Uh... No... We're sorry! We won't do it again!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.16,0:03:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give us that crap! \NWe can't let them off, Risa.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.13,0:03:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, they look like they're sorry. \NLet's let them go...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.08,0:03:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...if you thought I'd say that, \Nyou're dead wrong!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.55,0:03:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Strip 'em!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.17,0:03:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.07,0:03:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, no more!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.53,0:03:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.40,0:03:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.66,0:03:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.16,0:04:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive us!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.57,0:04:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, what a letdown. {???????? idk what she means but she looks disappointed for some reason}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.12,0:04:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... I just wanna get outta here. {go somewhere}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.37,0:04:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it easy.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.46,0:04:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, your family's full of doctors, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.06,0:04:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Find anything? {???????? i have no idea what they're talkin bout}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.46,0:04:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.98,0:04:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! It's that guy. The one who aced the mock exam the other day.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.72,0:04:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you know what they say —
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.41,0:04:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,guys who get perfect scores \Nend up flunking and becoming ronin. {trying for the same university next year}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.36,0:04:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're getting in through the back door, then... {??????}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.81,0:04:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Here...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.39,0:04:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first Valentine's chocolate I've ever gotten. {copied from episode 1}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.61,0:05:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's my first time giving Valentine's chocolate to a boy.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.14,0:05:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotono-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.77,0:05:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,One seafood, one Mexican Mix, \Nand one coleslaw salad!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.30,0:05:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be 3,600 yen.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.14,0:05:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Nice work. \NLet's take a little break.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.83,0:05:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kyohei, what are you saving up all this money for?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.16,0:05:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not telling.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.28,0:05:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's buying a motorcycle.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.16,0:05:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You never had one before, Kyohei? {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.22,0:05:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Only until this summer.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.54,0:05:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, cya. {thanks for the purchase}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.02,0:06:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyohei, this pineapple pizza wasn't ordered by anybody.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.31,0:06:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That one's on me. Just a little something to cheer you on for the live show.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.35,0:06:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.02,0:06:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought refreshments!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.52,0:06:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mari-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.29,0:06:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I found this cake that looked delicious, \Nso I thought of you, Senpai.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.70,0:06:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Now I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.44,0:06:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know I've got a real sweet tooth.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.50,0:06:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Senpai...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.79,0:06:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking this seriously, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.71,0:06:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Haven't I always been serious myself?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.51,0:06:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyaa! Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.80,0:06:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks as always!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.80,0:07:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotono-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.92,0:07:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Kotono-chan, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.76,0:07:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Masashi's been wanting to see you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.06,0:07:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Masashi really has stayed devoted all this time. {single-minded - I assume he means "never looked at any other girl since"}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.36,0:07:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you knew that better than anyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.38,0:07:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you contact him? \NHe's been waiting for you all this time.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.08,0:07:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've got your reasons, \Nbut every time I see how down Masashi is...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.94,0:07:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wish you'd at least give him a call.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.09,0:08:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.26,0:08:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You idiot! \NWhere the hell are you wandering off to?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.99,0:08:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You trying to bankrupt this place or what?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.89,0:08:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.59,0:08:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I was finally...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.31,0:08:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,finally starting to forget...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.65,0:08:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.38,0:08:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.16,0:08:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. But please, \Njust contact him at least once.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.69,0:08:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My cell number's on there too, so call me, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.70,0:08:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.47,0:08:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Your guitar solo was magical, Senpai!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.11,0:08:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We've totally got this battle of the bands! \NYou were so cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.14,0:08:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That was amazing! \NBut we've got one little problem...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.73,0:09:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The vocals are still kinda weak...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.98,0:09:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.36,0:09:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Isao...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.40,0:09:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,just leave it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.28,0:09:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you do something about that girl?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.53,0:09:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry. I'll talk to her.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.41,0:09:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.92,0:09:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyohei!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.63,0:09:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You can head home now. \NBut I'll dock today's slacking off from your pay.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.71,0:09:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw... come on...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.72,0:09:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kidding. \NJust don't forget your seal tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.80,0:09:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.97,0:09:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, can I take Bike No. 2 again today?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.62,0:09:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make sure you don't wreck it. {lit: if you get in an accident, don't come crying}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.32,0:09:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be careful.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.23,0:09:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, so this is where \Nyou've been working, Kyohei?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.76,0:09:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but more importantly, \Nwhat are you doing here?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.00,0:09:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I just thought I'd stop by.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.39,0:09:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell you this, \Nbut the pizza here sucks.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.00,0:10:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Want to go somewhere? \NI borrowed a bike.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.25,0:10:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? We're riding that?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.51,0:10:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It may not look like much, \Nbut she runs, all right.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.61,0:10:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have one that looks better?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.71,0:10:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My 250'll be delivered next week. {nihan = 2.5}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.33,0:10:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll reserve the first ride for you, Risa-chan. \NComplete with chauffeur.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.10,0:10:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it'll be okay? {the jalopy}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.07,0:10:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.88,0:10:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotono-cha—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.17,0:10:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,n?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.59,0:10:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I mistook you for someone else.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.52,0:11:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,When you look out at the ocean, don't you ever wonder where the waves come from?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.76,0:11:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously? That's awfully sentimental for you. {blue}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.45,0:11:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into Kotono-chan today by chance \Nand told her about Masashi.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.37,0:11:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But somehow... she felt so far away.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.96,0:11:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Miyuki still seems \Nto have feelings for Tomoya-kun too.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.74,0:11:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But she hasn't heard from him lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.84,0:11:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Long-distance relationships are tough.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.85,0:11:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ours isn't long-distance, though, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.68,0:11:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I earned my third dan in karate this spring!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.85,0:11:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm still a beginner when it comes to love... \Nso I can't answer that question right away.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.28,0:11:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to answer right away. \NJust think about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.67,0:12:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.09,0:12:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.72,0:12:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.06,0:12:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you home.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.98,0:12:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.89,0:12:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take the train.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.38,0:12:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.23,0:12:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't dislike you, Kyohei...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.70,0:12:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.74,0:12:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you again, right? \NI'll be waiting here tomorrow too!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.49,0:12:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsk...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.63,0:12:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't hate me, \Nthen don't say you're sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.93,0:13:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.02,0:13:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello... Kyohei-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.94,0:13:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kotono.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.43,0:13:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... there's something \NI'd like to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.36,0:13:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't tell Masashi-kun about this. {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.92,0:13:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.70,0:13:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then... tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.44,0:13:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My parents died when I was little, \Nand I was raised in a geisha teahouse. {ochaya}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.05,0:13:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The training was so strict that I had to quit school,\Nbut I earned my certifications in dance and song.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.03,0:13:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only an apprentice, \Nbut I've finally begun performing.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.20,0:13:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Masashi-kun is going to keep studying, \Nget into a good university, find a good job...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.62,0:13:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and someday meet a wonderful woman.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.23,0:13:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But that woman can't be me!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.00,0:13:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone like me isn't good enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.73,0:14:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's someone \Nmuch more worthy of Masashi-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.01,0:14:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been telling myself that all this time.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.64,0:14:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Masashi know any of this?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.75,0:14:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I never got to say anything to him, \Nnot even a "goodbye."
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.00,0:14:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought if I do that, then the version of me
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.70,0:14:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Masashi would remember \Nis gonna be the happiest one. {lit: with the best smile}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.55,0:14:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyohei-kun, Yuichi-kun, thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.51,0:14:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you two, I can finally move on.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.36,0:14:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotono-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.23,0:14:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,you still love Masashi, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.65,0:14:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then don't lie to yourself about how you feel!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.54,0:14:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe a love that pure still exists.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.38,0:14:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It just doesn't sit right with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.75,0:15:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... have you fallen for somebody lately?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.22,0:15:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.13,0:15:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.93,0:15:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you? \NWhat's going on with Saori?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.63,0:15:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business. \NSaori's just the vocalist in the band.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.35,0:15:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just it!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.06,0:15:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.75,0:15:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the answer.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.25,0:15:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,For the next battle of the bands, \Nlet's invite Masashi and Kotono-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.11,0:15:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Invite them?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.31,0:15:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If they see each other, they won't be able \Nto lie to themselves anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.78,0:15:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're acting kinda weird lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.45,0:15:29.70,Thought,,0,0,0,,You can't lie to your own feelings...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.31,0:15:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Risa-chan? It's me, Kyohei.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.52,0:15:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you right now? \NI'd like to see you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.37,0:15:57.52,Thought,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.52,0:16:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look... I know I came on to you \Npretty suddenly the other day...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.78,0:16:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But it wasn't just a spur-of-the-moment thing!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.90,0:16:03.50,Thought,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.50,0:16:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! H-Hey, wa—
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.53,0:16:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.63,0:16:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Risa?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.60,0:16:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So you really did come.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.81,0:16:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It really was just a spur-of-the-moment thing, wasn't it?! {that he tried to bed her}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.77,0:16:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You just wanted to have sex with me, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.53,0:16:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! {??? dunno, maybe actually "no"}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.90,0:16:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,To think I even gave you the benefit of doubt... {????? things like thinking about me}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.03,0:16:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You never had any real feelings \Nfor me to begin with!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.14,0:16:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.46,0:16:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.42,0:17:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.30,0:17:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,want to be with you all the time, Risa.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.52,0:17:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.19,0:17:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why would you let me go home alone? {yesterday I assume}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.32,0:18:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No... {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.07,0:18:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.39,0:18:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it. I'm really not \Nin the mood for that right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.40,0:18:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a mock exam the day after that. {???????????? no idea what's that moshidashi is}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.19,0:18:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel bad about Yuichi, \Nbut tell him I said thanks, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.02,0:18:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Masashi, when you got plastered \Nafter the school festival party,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.56,0:18:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuichi's the one who carried you home!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.63,0:18:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,At least come watch his big moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.24,0:18:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyohei... what are you plotting?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.61,0:18:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.71,0:19:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, so be it. I thought it'd be a nice break \Nfrom studying for entrance exams.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.79,0:19:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm never inviting you again!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.09,0:19:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyohei!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.30,0:19:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's it gonna be held? The concert.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.63,0:19:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.49,0:19:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they'll really come?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.62,0:19:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Masashi-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.96,0:19:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.38,0:19:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, this is for you, Saori-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.97,0:19:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.47,0:19:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure took your time. {lit: you're late, aintcha}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.63,0:19:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the concert wouldn't start without me. {????? lit: if I don't come, won't fire up - who or what? does he really consider himself that much of a party pony?}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.15,0:19:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Confident, aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.83,0:20:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotten fat since I last saw you?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.35,0:20:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell I have, idiot!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.26,0:20:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where on this body do you see any fat?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.90,0:20:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.04,0:20:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Masashi! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.20,0:20:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Go after her!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.26,0:20:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What, won't even stay \Nto watch our performance? Bleh... {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.19,0:20:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see you. Even though I kept telling myself I shouldn't,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.25,0:20:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never give up, and I was always searching for you, Kotono-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.41,0:21:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found you.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.75,0:21:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Masashi-kun, um...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.57,0:21:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, those guys are so pushy.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.39,0:21:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't fill your head \Nwith any weird ideas, did they?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.83,0:21:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.12,0:21:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I got to see you.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.81,0:21:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There was something \NI had to tell you face-to-face.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.43,0:21:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be working \Nat a geisha house in Kyoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.26,0:21:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving on the \N11:00 Shinkansen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.51,0:21:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.97,0:21:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.36,0:21:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll never see each other again!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.45,0:21:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.75,0:21:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,K-Kotono-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:18.03,0:22:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving on the 11:00 Shinkansen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:52.31,0:22:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's leaving?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:53.70,0:22:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's his deal?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:58.40,0:23:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotono!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:07.58,0:23:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotono!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:09.46,0:23:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Masashi...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.04,0:23:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Masashi! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:23.14,0:23:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyohei!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:25.76,0:23:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:27.21,0:23:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{??}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:28.39,0:23:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm borrowing this!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:32.77,0:23:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.62,0:23:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way! {?????}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:28.45,0:24:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:31.12,0:24:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm late.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:37.83,0:24:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Masashi-kun...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:39.23,0:24:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had to see you one more time.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:42.89,0:24:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:46.74,0:24:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel your heart pounding.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:49.82,0:24:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yours too, Kotono-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:53.06,0:24:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I finally got to see you again...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:26.30,0:25:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:28.09,0:25:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:32.64,0:25:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:35.14,0:25:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:36.24,0:25:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No... It's okay. \NYou're so gentle, Masashi-kun. {maybe "if you'll be kind"}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:10.43,0:26:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:11.50,0:26:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:26:14.35,0:26:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it. Okay, have a nice day!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:18.78,0:26:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Masashi's with Kotono-chan in Kyoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:22.00,0:26:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:23.58,0:26:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:24.48,0:26:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't sound like you mean it! {?????? maybe "obviously"}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:26.46,0:26:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:31.52,0:26:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Summer's almost over.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:33.74,0:26:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to come see you again \Nand again from now on.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:36.78,0:26:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:38.74,0:26:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring you a present next time.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:41.12,0:26:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:43.75,0:26:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already given me \Nso many wonderful things, Masashi-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:48.17,0:26:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:52.76,0:26:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll definitely come see you again soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:57.27,0:27:05.79,Song,,0,0,0,,A gentle breeze slips in through the window,
Dialogue: 10,0:27:05.79,0:27:14.57,Song,,0,0,0,,summer's gaze falling softly \Nacross my shoulders {Pretender by Chiba Chiemi; same deal as with ep 1 ending, translating by ear}
Dialogue: 10,0:27:14.57,0:27:21.58,Song,,0,0,0,,You appeared like tangled rays of light
Dialogue: 10,0:27:23.22,0:27:33.66,Song,,0,0,0,,A chance meeting I couldn't escape,\Nleaving me speechless
Dialogue: 10,0:27:34.10,0:27:37.49,Song,,0,0,0,,Just such hidden eyes... {hope I heard it right}
Dialogue: 10,0:27:37.49,0:27:42.29,Song,,0,0,0,,somebody tell me
Dialogue: 10,0:27:43.23,0:27:50.82,Song,,0,0,0,,these trembling heartbeats \Nare beyond counting
Dialogue: 10,0:27:51.26,0:27:54.55,Song,,0,0,0,,Just a little bit of love {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:27:54.55,0:28:08.42,Song,,0,0,0,,Even if this love disappears in ten seconds,\NI still want you to hold me
Dialogue: 10,0:28:10.13,0:28:27.50,Song,,0,0,0,,An ordinary emergency exit on a city building, its rusty door always kept shut
Dialogue: 10,0:28:27.50,0:28:34.91,Song,,0,0,0,,As the season begins to fade away, \NI run up and look at the moon
Dialogue: 10,0:28:35.95,0:28:41.45,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,5556)}hanging above the city skyline...
Comment: 0,0:28:41.45,0:28:44.45,Song,,0,0,0,,
